WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.334 --> 00:00:14.764
Jenna: Oh no. Sweetie's gone?

2
00:00:14.765 --> 00:00:19.902
Mrs. Ling: Yes. I left his cage unlocked.

3
00:00:19.903 --> 00:00:24.574
Mrs. Ling: And a window in the music room was open.

4
00:00:24.575 --> 00:00:27.152
Mark: Oh boy.

5
00:00:27.153 --> 00:00:30.806
Coby: He probably flew away.

6
00:00:30.807 --> 00:00:35.236
Kara: Yeah. I bet he's far, far away by now.

7
00:00:35.237 --> 00:00:38.029
Daisy: Don't say that, Kara.

8
00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:43.231
Daisy: You'll make Mrs. Ling feel even more upset!

9
00:00:43.232 --> 00:00:45.872
Mrs. Ling: I love that bird.

10
00:00:45.873 --> 00:00:49.488
Mrs. Ling: I hope nothing has happened to him.

11
00:00:49.489 --> 00:00:52.886
Miss Gray: Room Two can help you look for Sweetie.

12
00:00:52.887 --> 00:00:55.498
Kids: Yeah!

13
00:00:55.499 --> 00:00:59.309
Miss Gray: Boys, please come to the music room with me.

14
00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:12.749
Miss Gray: Girls, stay here with Mrs. Ling and look outside.

15
00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:18.171
Daisy: Sweetie! Come, Sweetie!

16
00:01:18.172 --> 00:01:20.050
Kara: He's not a dog, Daisy.

17
00:01:20.051 --> 00:01:21.898
He's a bird.

18
00:01:21.899 --> 00:01:24.758
Daisy: I know he's a bird!

19
00:01:24.759 --> 00:01:41.107
Jenna: Yeah, Kara. She can still call his name.

20
00:01:41.108 --> 00:01:43.561
Jenna: I have an idea, Mrs. Ling.

21
00:01:43.562 --> 00:01:45.932
Jenna: Sweetie loves music.

22
00:01:45.933 --> 00:01:48.605
Maybe we should sing.

23
00:01:48.606 --> 00:01:58.097
Mrs. Ling: Oh. That's a good idea, Jenna!

24
00:01:58.098 --> 00:02:07.138
Girls: La-la-la-la-la!

25
00:02:07.139 --> 00:02:11.133
Miss Gray: Sweetie! Where are you?

26
00:02:11.134 --> 00:02:14.085
Coby: Maybe we should put out some food for him.

27
00:02:14.086 --> 00:02:16.288
Miss Gray: Smart thinking, Coby.

28
00:02:16.289 --> 00:02:24.326
There's his food.

29
00:02:24.327 --> 00:02:27.240
Mark: I don't see him anywhere.

30
00:02:27.241 --> 00:02:36.599
Coby: Me neither. Poor Mrs. Ling.

31
00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:41.781
Mrs. Ling: Oh well. Singing was a good idea, girls.

32
00:02:41.782 --> 00:02:44.856
Mrs. Ling: But I'm afraid Kara is right.

33
00:02:44.857 --> 00:02:52.288
Sweetie is far away by now.

34
00:02:52.289 --> 00:02:55.742
Daisy: No, he's not! Look!

35
00:02:55.743 --> 00:02:58.748
Mrs. Ling: Sweetie!

36
00:02:58.749 --> 00:03:00.618
Sweetie: Tweet! Tweet!

37
00:03:00.619 --> 00:03:03.297
Mrs. Ling: Sweetie loves music.

38
00:03:03.298 --> 00:03:05.872
And he loves flowers!

39
00:03:05.873 --> 00:03:10.062
Mrs. Ling: I'm so glad today is Silly Hair Day!

40
00:03:10.063 --> 00:03:19.571
Jenna: Me too!
